 <!--
   ServerCard islands are created programmatically in server_browser.py.
   Each card is inserted into known_layout / unknown_layout before the
   trailing stretch spacer. The card itself is a QFrame subclass with:
     - Server name (bold, 11pt)
     - Per-feature rows: class name + version, then originator/category below
     - UUID (8pt, dim)
     - [+] button (orange circle, top-right of card)
   The manual entry dialog (_ManualEntryDialog) is also built in Python —
   it is too simple (host QLineEdit + port QSpinBox + OK/Cancel) to warrant
   its own .ui file.
 -->

